start.description:
The scooter configured for {node} is not paired with the ESP — its bond was lost (a firmware update can do this).

Scooter: {mac}
In range: {range}
Signal (RSSI): {rssi}

The scooter must be unlocked and you need physical access to its dashboard, since the passkey is shown there. Choose “Start pairing” below: only then does the ESP connect and the scooter show a 6-digit passkey, which you'll enter on the next screen. Nothing is sent to the scooter until you press it.
